<title>HUNGARY: Hungary jobless rate rises to 11.1 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Hungary jobless rate rises to 11.1 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate rose to 11.1 percent in February 1997 from 10.6 percent in January 1997, the Labour Ministry said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>    HUNGARY JOBLESS	   Feb 97	Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p>    registered unemployed  498,080     474,500	530,592</p>
<p>    rate (pct)		  11.1	  10.6	   11.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The basis for calculating the unemployment rate was updated to the size of the active population on January 1, 1996 from the previous basis of active population on January 1, 1995, the ministry said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4</p>
</text>
